<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-23a4c3f098b125a3.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Polaris 9650iQ Sport vs Aiper Scuba S1: Premium Corded vs Cordless Convenience - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="Compare the Polaris 9650iQ Sport and Aiper Scuba S1 across navigation, cordless convenience, wall cleaning, debris handling, and long-term value."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/blog/polaris-9650iq-sport-vs-aiper-scuba-s1"/><meta property="og:title" content="Polaris 9650iQ Sport vs Aiper Scuba S1: Premium Corded vs Cordless Convenience"/><meta property="og:description" content="Compare the Polaris 9650iQ Sport and Aiper Scuba S1 across navigation, cordless convenience, wall cleaning, debris handling, and long-term value."/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta property="article:published_time" content="2026-06-03"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><nav aria-label="breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li><li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Blog</li></ol></nav><article><h1 class="mb-4">Polaris 9650iQ Sport vs Aiper Scuba S1: Premium Corded vs Cordless Convenience</h1><p class="text-muted mb-5">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><div><h2>Quick Verdict</h2><p>The <strong>Polaris 9650iQ Sport</strong> is the stronger cleaner for complex inground pools, premium navigation, waterline cleaning, and heavy-duty ownership.</p><p>The <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> is the more convenient option for buyers who want cordless operation and easier handling at a lower price.</p><h2>At-a-Glance Comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Polaris 9650iQ Sport</th><th>Aiper Scuba S1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Design</td><td>Corded premium</td><td>Cordless</td></tr><tr><td>Navigation</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Wall Cleaning</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Waterline Cleaning</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Moderate to Good</td></tr><tr><td>Ease of Handling</td><td>Good</td><td>Excellent</td></tr><tr><td>Best For</td><td>Complex pools</td><td>Convenience buyers</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Cleaning Performance</h2><p>The Polaris 9650iQ Sport is built for premium cleaning. Its mobility system, app features, and strong waterline behavior make it a better fit for demanding pools.</p><p>The Aiper Scuba S1 is much easier to live with physically, but it is not trying to be the same type of machine. It is a cordless convenience cleaner first.</p><h2>Value</h2><p>The Aiper offers stronger value if your pool is moderate in size and you want to avoid cords. The Polaris is worth the extra money only if your pool benefits from its stronger navigation and waterline cleaning.</p><h2>Final Recommendation</h2><p>Choose the <strong>Polaris 9650iQ Sport</strong> for performance. Choose the <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> for convenience and lower cost.</p><h2>Related Resources</h2><ul><li><a href='/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport'>Polaris 9650iQ Sport Review</a></li><li><a href='/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1'>Aiper Scuba S1 Review</a></li><li><a href='/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners'>Polaris vs Dolphin</a></li><li><a href='/best-of/value'>Best Value Robotic Pool Cleaners</a></li></ul><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Is the Polaris 9650iQ Sport worth more than the Aiper Scuba S1?</h3><p>It can be if your pool is large, complex, or needs stronger wall and waterline cleaning.</p><h3>Which is easier to use?</h3><p>The Aiper Scuba S1 is easier to handle because it is cordless.</p></div><div class="mt-5"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/reviews">Find Your Perfect Robot</a></div></div></div></article></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"308\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-23a4c3f098b125a3.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[5826,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"308\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-23a4c3f098b125a3.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\ne:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/3"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"26-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a