ith physically, but it is not trying to be the same type of machine. It is a cordless convenience cleaner first.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eValue\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Aiper offers stronger value if your pool is moderate in size and you want to avoid cords. The Polaris is worth the extra money only if your pool benefits from its stronger navigation and waterline cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFinal Recommendation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose the \u003cstrong\u003ePolaris 9650iQ Sport\u003c/strong\u003e for performance. Choose the \u003cstrong\u003eAiper Scuba S1\u003c/strong\u003e for convenience and lower cost.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRelated Resources\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport'\u003ePolaris 9650iQ Sport Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1'\u003eAiper Scuba S1 Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners'\u003ePolaris vs Dolphin\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/best-of/value'\u003eBest Value Robotic Pool Cleaners\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIs the Polaris 9650iQ Sport worth more than the Aiper Scuba S1?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt can be if your pool is large, complex, or needs stronger wall and waterline cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhich is easier to use?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Aiper Scuba S1 is easier to handle because it is cordless.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"buildId\":\"ibMnxLVRNd6eQkSmhgFst\",\"asse